body:
@Chaosed0 I think your assessment is correct. I have been looking at this issue today.

On my threadripper this occurs 100% of the time, with up to 16 threads trying to construct a `decimillipede_suck_shader.tres` at once :)

I'm trying to come up with a way to make the deadlock prevention a bit smarter. We could just whack a mutex or similar on the loader but that seems like kind of an "expensive" solution.
